#!/usr/bin/env node
/**
 * Offline Forge Core fixture for the Android native client.
 *
 * Real: Core's built Web host (`dist/web/server.js`) and its controller/runtime
 * host (`dist/host/runtime.js`), including HTTP RPC, WebSocket events, run
 * cancellation, the approval handshake and the durable input queue store in
 * `dist/core/input-queue.js`.
 *
 * Fake: one in-memory `HarnessService`, plus metadata-only settings/MCP/checkpoint
 * data. It never reads Forge configuration, sessions, provider credentials or the
 * network. All generated files live under
 * android/.gradle/native-fixture/ and are removed on Ctrl+C/SIGTERM.
 */
